sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client / load generator
  participant G as gateway (local)
  participant I as inventory-a (aws-simulated)
  participant J as inventory-b (gcp-simulated)
  participant P as pricing (azure-simulated)
  C->>G: POST /api/orders {sku, quantity, tier} + X-Request-ID / traceparent
  Note over G: validate · assign request_id · start deadline (outer bound)
  par parallel call mode (sequential mode: inventory, then pricing)
    G->>G: wait injected delay/2 (local→aws)
    G->>I: POST /v1/stock (timeout T, ≤ r retries, breaker check)
    alt healthy
      I-->>G: 200 {available}
    else error / timeout / breaker open
      G->>J: POST /v1/stock (fallback replica, delay local→gcp)
      J-->>G: 200 {available}
    end
    G->>G: wait injected delay/2 (aws→local)
  and
    G->>P: POST /v1/quote (timeout T, + injected delay local↔azure)
    alt healthy
      P-->>G: 200 {unit_price}
    else failure
      G->>G: degraded: list-price fallback, flagged
    end
  end
  G-->>C: 200 confirmed | 200 degraded | 503 unavailable (+ timings, routing decision, resilience events)
